	(text "Gate and Kelvin of each device as coupled pairs of equal length (+/-10 %) from the COM star; Ron, Roff, Kelvin\nR, 10k, Zeners at each device. Clamp FET + C_VL at its device's gate-Kelvin pins, loop <= 1 nH. DESAT string\n>= 2.5 mm pad gap per diode; board coated to PD1 (IC-22). Miller hold (ngspice, gdrv): die +1.41 V vs VGS(th)\nmin 1.94 V at 175 C - BENCH TEST. Driver input side and bias primary decoupled to GND locally (CM current)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 324.12 308.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "01a9cf9e-eb4f-559c-bc64-c976275c139a")
	)
	(text "P4S1: LOGIC SIDE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0528a811-9a49-5818-96ee-e15dcf4a2d1a")
	)
	(text "DESAT pin (internal 500 uA blanking source, trip 8.5-9.8 V) - Rs - 3 x US1M - drain.\nBAT54S keeps DX between COM and VDD against dv/dt through the string; Cblk footprint DNP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 117.6 251.312 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1455edbb-6503-5912-9a90-f98fdac3c91a")
	)
	(text "Per device: Ron/Roff, 0.5R Kelvin R to the COM star, 10k and Zeners (about +21 V / -5.7 V) on its own Kelvin net.\nMiller hold: N-MOSFET clamp (PMV30ENEA) gate-pin to a local VEE (1u on the Kelvin pin). LAYOUT: FET + 1u at the device, loop <= 1 nH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.904 140.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2ad91803-ac7b-5ec5-a336-14b5be8d1e29")
	)
	(text "DESAT > 10.3-10.9 V (above the 9.8 V maximum trip) -> MMBT3904 -> MMBT3906 charges BG to VEE + 10 V;\nper device AO3400A + 22R pull the gate to VEE; BG holds ~3 us (1k + FET gates)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 125.52 378.224 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3e3267fb-08de-5a80-8ec9-06efdad7592f")
	)
	(text "P4S2: LOGIC SIDE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 212.6 153.4 0)
		(effects
